  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "- Wait a minute !! -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "- Currently you're carrying -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "- too many items with you. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "- Please try again -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "- after you lose some weight. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "[Leablem]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "Good day. My name is Leablem,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "and I'm a technician that specializes in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "adding slots to weapons and armors."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "It can be very hard sometimes, but I like"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "what I do, and take pride in it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "[Leablem]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "I've learned most of the things from my brother, Seyablem,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "but I think I still have a lot to learn."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "So please understand my slotting services are limited,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "unlike my brother Seyablem."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "[Leablem]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "My brother wasn't so happy to teach me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "his skills because he was worried that his skills"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "wouldn't be unique anymore. He did, however, his best"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "to teach me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "[Leablem]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "Thanks to him, I've learned lots of things."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "I'm not very confident"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "in trying many different things,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "but I'll do what"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "I can do for now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "[Leablem]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "In fact, there's one thing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "that my brother doesn't want me to do."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "I don't want to upset him, so...let's just skip that part."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "I'll say no more about it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "[Leablem]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "Anyways, do you have any equipment"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "which you'd like to add to the slots?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "My service charge, the materials,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "and the success chance all depend on"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "the specific item I'm working on."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "Weapon"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "Armor"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "About that thing you skipped"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "More information"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Leablem",
      "text" : "Quit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
